        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Paper, wood-containing, LWC, at regional storage
na;
UUID: 3876629d-2cba-3bc0-b005-eb393169f9f4
This module includes the transport from the production site to a central distribution site within Switzerland for the domestic and the foreign LWC paper consumed in Switzerland.; Geography: Deliveries within/to Switzerland according to official Swiss trade statistics with country-specific transport distances.
Location: Deliveries within/to Switzerland according to official Swiss trade statistics with country-specific transport distances.
Technology: Average situation
Time period: undefined
Production volume: Total Swiss graphic paper consumption 2000: 725.8 kt (official statistics)
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: Standard distances for domestic production, imports from neighbourhood countries and imports from scandinavian countries.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3876629d-2cba-3bc0-b005-eb393169f9f4.xml</text>
